[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3634818367","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113823#issuecomment-3634818367","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113823","id":3634818367,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ypu0_","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T00:16:37Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T00:16:37Z","body":"Great job! Let's hold off on merging until we understand the issue better. It is very strange that post-processing in a subpass worked before https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110077 was merged. Even more strange is that with the changes in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110077 the only difference between the code before and after is that the shader compiles out a bunch of code that was previously behind dynamic branches. So the behaviour really shouldn't change. \r\n\r\nThat being said, I have a few theories about what could be happening at the driver level to result in this crash. And the solution for most of them is just to avoid subpasses in this case. So I do think that this could end up being the \"correct\" solution once we know more about the problem","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3634818367/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3634850265","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113823#issuecomment-3634850265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113823","id":3634850265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Yp2nZ","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T00:29:46Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T00:29:46Z","body":"Would RenderDoc help? \r\n\r\nI'm not sure if my Chromebook can handle it though (4 GB RAM, only cost €169 a year ago).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3634850265/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3635595725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113823#issuecomment-3635595725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113823","id":3635595725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YssnN","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T06:29:43Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T06:29:43Z","body":"> Would RenderDoc help?\r\n\r\nNo. Renderdoc just displays what is happening at the Vulkan API level. It doesn't give you insight into what is in the driver. \r\n\r\nIn this case we know it is a driver bug, so Renderdoc won't help us identify the bug. Renderdoc is helpful to quickly get an understanding of all the Vulkan state at the time of the crash though ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3635595725/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":